      "side": 1,
      "message": "`aconfigDeclarationsTag` is used for entries listed in [`aconfig_declarations`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/java/droidstubs.go;drc\u003d5919815f80cb8da3d28a7cb4692245ac82c114f4;l\u003d454) property, which are \"a list of aconfig_declarations module names that the stubs generated in this (droidstubs) module depend on.\" I believe that implicitly adding srcjars as deps for an entry listed as `aconfig_declaration` property may lead to confusion for users. If the user were to retrieve the collected srcjars of the `aconfig_declarations_group` module type, the user can utilize the output file tag as seen below:\n```\naconfig_declarations_group {\n    name: \"foo\",\n    java_aconfig_libraries: [\n    ...\n    ],\n}\n\ndroidstubs {\n    name: \"bar\",\n    srcs: [\n        \":foo{.srcjars}\"\n    ],\n```",
